# VHS tape (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs) for a README GIF: `vhs scripts/demo.tape`
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1300
Set Height 900
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "uv run afr demo --scenario repeat" Enter
Sleep 12s
Type "clear" Enter
Type "uv run afr demo --scenario trap" Enter
Sleep 10s
